Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.84,0:04:25.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.72,0:06:47.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想喝点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.03,0:06:55.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我是说真家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I mean a real drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.77,0:06:59.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如说酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}As in alcohol.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.41,0:07:04.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从没喝过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never had one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.04,0:07:07.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause of my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.67,0:07:11.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他不在了  所以...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he's not exactly around anymore, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.44,0:07:19.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我们可以去找一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we could go find some.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.27,0:07:30.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.37,0:07:34.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慢慢吃你的蛇肉干吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, enjoy your snake jerky.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.97,0:07:56.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.44,0:08:58.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们好像找到路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we made it a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.11,0:09:02.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很肯定得走那边才找的到酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pretty sure we got to go that way to find the booze.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.65,0:09:05.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.45,0:09:06.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你又把我带回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You brought me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.96,0:09:09.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不要待在那个逊毙了的营地\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not staying in this suck-ass camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.95,0:09:11.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你玩够了没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! You had your fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.85,0:09:14.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有毛病吗  你难道没感情吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is wrong with you? Do you feel anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.76,0:09:17.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  你觉得一切都玩完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you think everything's screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.66,0:09:19.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想那也是一种感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess that's a feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.41,0:09:20.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你想盯着一堆火\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you want to spend the rest of our lives
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.67,0:09:22.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃着泥蛇度过余生吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}staring into a fire and eating mud snakes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.22,0:09:24.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.03,0:09:26.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们倒不如做点别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We might as well do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.10,0:09:29.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能照顾好自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can take care of myself
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.55,0:09:31.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定要去喝杯酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm gonna get a damn drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.11,0:09:57.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,高尔夫球手嗜酒成性  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Golfers like to booze it up, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.03,0:10:03.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.52,0:10:16.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(松景乡村俱乐部)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.46,0:10:22.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,里面可能有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might be people inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.72,0:10:52.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.15,0:12:20.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(华盛顿特区  国会大厦)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.28,0:12:33.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要拿那些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you keeping all that stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.44,0:12:42.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.32,0:15:02.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for the help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.25,0:15:05.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说过能照顾好自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you could take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.39,0:15:06.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.94,0:15:10.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(欢迎来到  狗宅)
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.15,0:16:37.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(富家婊)
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.24,0:16:45.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(富家婊)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.06,0:17:02.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮我把她放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me take her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.77,0:17:04.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无所谓了  她死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It don't matter. She's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.38,0:17:05.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}It does matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.39,0:17:15.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.36,0:17:38.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.53,0:17:46.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.17,0:19:11.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.35,0:19:17.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你觉得这很傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you think this is stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.93,0:19:20.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能真的很傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it probably is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.62,0:19:23.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.30,0:19:26.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我今天只想躺下大哭\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I wanted to do today was lay down and cry,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.44,0:19:27.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我们没这个权力\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we don't get to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.63,0:19:32.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以要是想撒气的话就去暴打行尸好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So beat up on walkers if that makes you feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.92,0:19:35.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我必须这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.36,0:20:06.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有必要弄碎玻璃吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you have to break the glass?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.80,0:20:07.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.89,0:20:11.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你找到喝的了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have your drink yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.14,0:20:12.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.22,0:20:15.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我找到这个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I found this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.95,0:20:19.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桃味蒸馏酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peach schnapps.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.69,0:20:23.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好喝吗  -不好喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is it good? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.30,0:20:28.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只剩下这个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's the only thing left.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.75,0:21:00.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,何必用酒杯呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who needs a glass?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.55,0:22:00.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你第一次喝酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't gonna have your first drink
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.09,0:22:01.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能就喝这个破桃味蒸馏酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}be no damned peach schnapps.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.78,0:22:07.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.38,0:22:22.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摩托车修理工\N{\fnArial\fs30}A motorcycle mechanic.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.42,0:22:25.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-什么  -我猜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Huh? - That's my guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.37,0:22:28.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,灾变前你所从事的职业\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what you were doing before the turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.95,0:22:30.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,扎克也是这么猜的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did Zack ever guess that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.79,0:22:31.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无关紧要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It don't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.38,0:22:33.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经无关紧要很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hasn't mattered for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.75,0:22:36.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人们就是这么聊天的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just what people talk about,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.76,0:22:38.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了感觉自己是个正常人\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, to feel normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.76,0:22:41.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从没觉得这么聊很正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, that never felt normal to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.79,0:22:49.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟米琼恩找到的这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found this place with Michonne.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.74,0:22:54.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为是酒水店\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was expecting a liquor store.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.76,0:22:56.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是  这个更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, this is better.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.96,0:23:15.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.44,0:23:19.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,私酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moonshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.26,0:23:22.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.70,0:23:53.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.47,0:23:59.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这才是第一次该喝的酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a real first drink right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.77,0:24:04.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.24,0:24:07.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.61,0:24:09.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.63,0:24:13.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爸总是说  喝劣质私酒会致盲\N{\fnArial\fs30}my dad always said bad moonshine can make you go blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.03,0:24:15.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正外面也没有什么值得看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't nothing worth seeing out there anymore anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.48,0:24:27.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我喝过的最恶心的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the most disgusting thing I've ever tasted.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.25,0:24:38.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喝到第二口就好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Second round's better.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.29,0:24:40.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慢点喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.82,0:24:43.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-这杯是给你倒的  -不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This one's for you. - No, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.11,0:24:46.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-为什么  -得有个人留神\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - Someone's got to keep watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.50,0:24:48.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么  你现在是我的保护人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, you're like my chaperone now?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.14,0:24:50.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就多喝点水吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just drink lots of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.42,0:24:51.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是  迪克森先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Mr. Dixon.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.73,0:25:02.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁会走进一家商店\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who'd go into a store
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.13,0:25:03.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后拎着这玩意儿出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and walk out with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.73,0:25:06.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爸  他就愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad, that's who.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.70,0:25:08.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就是个傻帽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he's a dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.87,0:25:11.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会把那些摆在电视上\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd set those up on top of the TV set,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.86,0:25:13.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用它们来练射击\N{\fnArial\fs30}use them as target practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.80,0:25:15.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在家里开枪射击吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He shot things inside your house?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.18,0:25:17.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正那只是一堆垃圾\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just a bunch of junk anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.99,0:25:20.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我知道这地方以前是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how I knew what this place was.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.63,0:25:21.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外面的那个棚屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}That shed out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.89,0:25:23.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爸之前也有那样的棚屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}my dad had a place just like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.19,0:25:25.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有个大靠椅\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got your Dumpster chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.24,0:25:29.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你坐在上头  抽屉里全是夏季饮料\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's for sitting in and your drawers all summer drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.59,0:25:32.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,旁边有个花哨的大桶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got your fancy buckets.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.28,0:25:33.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是用来吐嚼烟的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's for spitting chaw in
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.27,0:25:36.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你家老太婆叫你戒烟\N{\fnArial\fs30}after your old lady tells you to stop smoking.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.48,0:25:40.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个是你的"互联网"\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got your Internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.90,0:25:53.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-只有一个  -我们要去干掉它吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's just one of 'em. - Should we get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.76,0:25:55.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假如它一直吵个不停  那就干掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he keeps making too much noise, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.75,0:25:59.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假如我们又要被困住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if we're gonna be trapped again,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.35,0:26:01.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们最好随遇而安\N{\fnArial\fs30}we might as well make the best of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.53,0:26:06.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非你忙着保护我  迪克森先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you're too busy chaperoning, Mr. Dixon.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.69,0:26:12.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对啊  最好随遇而安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, might as well make the best of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.84,0:26:22.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,家  可爱的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home, sweet home.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.95,0:26:34.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首先  我说一件我从没做过的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So first, I say something I've never done
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.37,0:26:36.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假如你做过这件事  你就得喝酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if you have done it, you drink,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.31,0:26:38.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假如你没做过  那就我喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if you haven't, I drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.68,0:26:39.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后换你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we switch.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.80,0:26:43.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的不知道这个游戏吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really don't know this game?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.68,0:26:45.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从不需要游戏来喝醉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never needed a game to get lit before.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.03,0:26:47.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  我们开始玩了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, are we starting?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.93,0:26:50.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你从哪学的  -我朋友玩过\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do you know this game? - My friends played.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.82,0:26:53.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看过  好了  从我开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}I watched. Okay, I'll start.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.45,0:26:57.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从没射过十字弩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never shot a crossbow.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.77,0:27:00.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你喝酒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now you drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.45,0:27:02.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不算游戏吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't much of a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.15,0:27:06.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,热身而已  换你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a warm-up. Now you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.44,0:27:10.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.58,0:27:12.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随便说你想到的第一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just say the first thing that pops into your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.70,0:27:15.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从没出过乔治亚州\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never been out of Georgia.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.56,0:27:19.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗  这个不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Okay, good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.63,0:27:24.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从没\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.97,0:27:27.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喝醉做出后悔的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}been drunk and did something I regretted.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.53,0:27:34.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我倒干过很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've done a lot of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.01,0:27:37.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,轮到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.23,0:27:42.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从没度过假\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never been on vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.99,0:27:44.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,野营算吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about camping?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.14,0:27:47.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不算  那只是学打猎的必修课\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that was just something I had to learn to hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.10,0:27:49.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你爸爸教你的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad teach you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.19,0:27:54.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.18,0:28:02.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从没\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.67,0:28:03.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进过监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}been in jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.23,0:28:07.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  没当过囚犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, as a prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.47,0:28:15.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是那么看我的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what you think of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.00,0:28:17.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是说什么大事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't mean anything serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.29,0:28:19.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是喝醉被拘留什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just thought, you know, like the drunk tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.17,0:28:23.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连我爸都因此进过牢房\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even my dad got locked up for that back in the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.70,0:28:25.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-喝吧  -等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Drink up. - Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.38,0:28:26.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狱警\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prison guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.72,0:28:28.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以前是狱警吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you a prison guard before?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.76,0:28:32.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.72,0:28:37.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又轮到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your turn again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.88,0:28:44.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去小便\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna take a piss.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.94,0:28:49.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.95,0:28:51.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听不清  我在小便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't hear you! I'm taking a piss!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.09,0:28:53.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔  别这么大声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl, don't talk so loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.60,0:28:54.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么  你是我的保护人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, are you my chaperone now?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.08,0:29:01.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.61,0:29:02.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,轮到我了对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my turn, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.85,0:29:05.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从没\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never--
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.98,0:29:09.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从没吃过酸奶冰淇淋\N{\fnArial\fs30}never eaten frozen yogurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.80,0:29:11.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从没养过宠物小马\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never had a pet pony.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.57,0:29:13.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从没收过圣诞老人的礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never got nothing from Santa Claus.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.53,0:29:16.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从不需要他人庇护\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never relied on anyone for protection before.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.48,0:29:19.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈的  老子从没依赖过任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, I don't think I've ever relied on anyone for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.91,0:29:21.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-达里尔  -我从没当着大伙儿的面唱歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Daryl. - Never sung out in front of a big group
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.99,0:29:24.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以为这一切很有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}out in public like everything was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.53,0:29:27.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以为这是一场游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like everything was a big game.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.61,0:29:32.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我他妈的也从没割腕求关注  \N{\fnArial\fs30}I sure as hell never cut my wrists looking for attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.33,0:29:38.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听起来外面的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like our friend out there
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.46,0:29:39.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在召唤它的兄弟们\N{\fnArial\fs30}is trying to call all of his buddies.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.53,0:29:42.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-达里尔  快住嘴  -嘿  你从没用过弩是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Daryl, just shut up. - Hey, you never shot a crossbow before?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.85,0:29:44.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在就教你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna teach you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.39,0:29:46.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧  会很有趣的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. It's gonna be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.50,0:29:49.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该待在屋里  达里尔  住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should stay inside. Daryl, cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.95,0:29:50.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.45,0:29:53.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蠢货  来呀  蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dumbass. Come here, dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.06,0:29:56.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-达里尔  -你想试试吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Daryl. - You want to shoot?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.07,0:29:58.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我不会  -很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know how. - Oh, it's easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.87,0:30:00.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来  瞄准右角  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here. Right corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.21,0:30:02.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以后再练吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's practice later.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.98,0:30:05.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-接着来  很有趣  -别闹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, it's fun. - Just stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.21,0:30:07.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-达里尔  -过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Daryl! - Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.97,0:30:12.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-八球进洞  -快干掉它\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eight ball. - Just kill it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.06,0:30:15.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格林  过来  我们把箭拔出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here, Greene. Let's pull these out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.03,0:30:16.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那它当靶子多练练手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a little more target practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.90,0:30:22.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你杀它干嘛  爷正乐着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell you do that for? I was having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.72,0:30:25.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才不  你太混蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you were being a jackass.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.05,0:30:27.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-如果有人对我老爸...  -别\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If anyone found my dad-- - Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.19,0:30:28.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这两个根本不是一回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That ain't remotely the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.70,0:30:31.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀行尸不应该是有趣的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing them is not supposed to be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.27,0:30:32.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你到底要我怎么做  丫头\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want from me, girl, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.54,0:30:33.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想让你别一副\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to you stop acting
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.71,0:30:35.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么都不在意的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}like you don't give a crap about anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.81,0:30:37.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就好像我们经历的这一切都毫无意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like nothing we went through matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.94,0:30:41.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些去世的人对你来说都一文不值一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like none of the people we lost meant anything to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.96,0:30:43.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这太混账了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.39,0:30:46.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你是这么想的吗  -我知道就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that what you think? - That's what I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.46,0:30:48.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么也不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.48,0:30:51.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道在你眼里我只是个将死的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you look at me and you just see another dead girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.23,0:30:54.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是米琼恩  不是卡萝儿  也不是玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not Michonne. I'm not Carol. I'm not Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.21,0:30:56.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我活下来了  你却不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've survived and you don't get it
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.78,0:30:59.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我不像你或者其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I'm not like you or them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.96,0:31:03.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我做到了  你不能因为自己畏惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I made it and you don't get to treat me like crap
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.48,0:31:05.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样对我\N{\fnArial\fs30}just because you're afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.37,0:31:10.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我无所畏惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't afraid of nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.36,0:31:13.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.31,0:31:18.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当那个小女孩跟在我妈身后\N{\fnArial\fs30}When that little girl came out of the barn
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.02,0:31:20.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从谷仓出来时\N{\fnArial\fs30}after my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.19,0:31:23.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就跟我一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.73,0:31:26.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而从那以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now God forbid
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.95,0:31:29.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就不敢亲近任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}you ever let anybody get too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.03,0:31:32.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲近是吗  你当然懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too close, huh? You know all about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.17,0:31:35.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你失去了两个男友  一滴眼泪都没流\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lost two boyfriends, you can't even shed a tear.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.15,0:31:36.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你全家人都没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your whole family's gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.49,0:31:37.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你却像个愚蠢的大学生一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}all you can do is just go out looking for hooch
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.75,0:31:39.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出去找酒喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}like some dumb college bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.10,0:31:40.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去你的  你根本不了解情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw you. You don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.82,0:31:42.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你不了解情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.15,0:31:44.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们认识的人都死了  -你根本不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Everyone we know is dead! - You don't know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.90,0:31:47.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么差别  因为你再也不会见到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might as well be, 'cause you ain't never gonna see 'em again.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.74,0:31:53.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克  你再也见不到玛姬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick. You ain't never gonna see Maggie again.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.48,0:31:55.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-达里尔  别说了  -不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Daryl, just stop.  - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.77,0:31:58.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总督直接来到了我们家门口\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Governor rolled right up to our gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.80,0:32:05.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果当初我没有停止寻找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe if I wouldn't have stopped looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.06,0:32:07.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许这一切都是我的错  因为我放弃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe 'cause I gave up. That's on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.84,0:32:09.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-达里尔  -不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Daryl.  - No--
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.76,0:32:16.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有你爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.56,0:32:22.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许  我本可以做点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe-- maybe I could have done something.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.32,0:32:53.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白我爸为什么戒酒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get why my dad stopped drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.28,0:32:55.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想吐吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You feel sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.48,0:32:57.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.37,0:33:01.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望我能一直有这样的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could feel like this all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.64,0:33:04.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.39,0:33:07.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.39,0:33:07.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很幸运  你是个快乐的醉鬼(形容酒品好)\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lucky you're a happy drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.42,0:33:08.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  我很幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.15,0:33:12.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有的人喝醉后就各种撒泼耍赖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some people can be real jerks when they drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.08,0:33:16.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  我喝醉之后就那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm a dick when I'm drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.97,0:33:27.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莫尔有个毒贩朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merle had this dealer.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.86,0:33:31.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个讨人嫌的小个子白人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This janky little white guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.90,0:33:33.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瘾君子\N{\fnArial\fs30}A tweaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.50,0:33:39.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,某天  我们在他家看电视\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day we were over at his house watching TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.14,0:33:46.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没到中午  我们都喝高了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't even noon yet and we were all wasted.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.05,0:33:47.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莫尔嗑嗨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merle was high.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.71,0:33:51.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在看一个电视节目\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were watching this show
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.75,0:33:54.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莫尔一直说那个节目很难看\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Merle was talking all this dumb stuff about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.28,0:33:56.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不肯闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he wouldn't let up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.46,0:33:59.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他一直如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merle never could.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.40,0:34:03.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turns out,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.97,0:34:07.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是那瘾君子的孩子们最喜欢的节目\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was the tweaker's kids' favorite show.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.97,0:34:10.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他从没见过他的孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he never sees his kids,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.14,0:34:13.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以他觉得内疚了之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}so he felt guilty about it or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.55,0:34:17.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以狠狠揍在莫尔脸上\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he punches Merle in the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.34,0:34:22.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我就狠狠地揍那瘾君子\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I started hitting the tweaker, like, hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.66,0:34:23.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能多狠就多狠\N{\fnArial\fs30}As hard as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.59,0:34:28.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他抽出一把枪来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then he pulls a gun,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.02,0:34:29.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顶着我的脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}sticks it right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.19,0:34:33.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说  我要杀了你  混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says, "I'm gonna kill you, bitch."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.04,0:34:35.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以莫尔也抽出枪来对着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Merle pulls his gun on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.07,0:34:39.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都在大吼  我也大吼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone's yelling. I'm yelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.97,0:34:45.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为我会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.81,0:34:51.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就因为一个会讲话的小狗的蠢动画\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over a dumb cartoon about a talking dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.35,0:34:59.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们怎么脱险的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you get out of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.42,0:35:04.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瘾君子揍了我肚子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tweaker punched me in the gut.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.89,0:35:06.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我吐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I puked.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.73,0:35:10.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们俩就开始笑  忘了这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}They both started laughing and forgot all about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.50,0:35:17.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想知道灾难之前我是什么样的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to know what I was before all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.18,0:35:23.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟着莫尔四处漂流\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just drifting around with Merle...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.55,0:35:28.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他让我做什么我就做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doing whatever he said we were gonna be doing that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.40,0:35:35.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我微不足道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.99,0:35:41.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一无是处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.63,0:35:45.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是个混蛋乡巴佬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some redneck asshole
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.50,0:35:50.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有个更混蛋的哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}and an even bigger asshole for a brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.25,0:35:58.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想他了  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You miss him, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.72,0:36:03.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也想玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.75,0:36:08.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想念她支使我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss her bossing me around.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.06,0:36:12.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想念我哥哥沙恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss my big brother Shawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.60,0:36:16.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他曾经很烦  过度保护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was so annoying and overprotective.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.27,0:36:22.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.74,0:36:24.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought--
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.37,0:36:28.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我曾希望他余生生活得平静安逸  知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hoped he'd just live the rest of his life in peace, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.25,0:36:35.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为玛姬和格伦会有个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought Maggie and Glenn would have a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.68,0:36:38.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爸爸会当上姥爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he'd get to be a grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.32,0:36:43.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一起过生日  度假\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we'd have birthdays and holidays
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.75,0:36:45.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有夏日野餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}and summer picnics.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.66,0:36:52.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后他会变老\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he'd get really old.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.77,0:36:59.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死亡会来临  但会很平静\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it'd happen, but it'd be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.11,0:37:05.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'd be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.22,0:37:11.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的周围会是他爱的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd be surrounded by people he loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.74,0:37:32.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是这么难以置信的蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how unbelievably stupid I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.41,0:37:39.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本来就该是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how it was supposed to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.65,0:37:47.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真希望我可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could just...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.99,0:37:50.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}change.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.33,0:37:52.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.26,0:37:54.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.16,0:37:56.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不像你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.31,0:37:59.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好像天生就适合现在的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like you were made for how things are now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.09,0:38:02.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是习惯了  糟糕的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just used to it, things being ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.35,0:38:04.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在这种地方长大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Growing up in a place like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.05,0:38:07.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你逃离了这种地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you got away from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.94,0:38:11.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我没有  -你有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I didn't. - You did.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.65,0:38:14.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许你该时不时提醒一下我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you got to keep on reminding me sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.28,0:38:15.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.77,0:38:19.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不可以依赖别人  记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't depend on anybody for anything, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.44,0:38:26.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我早晚也会离开  -别这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll be gone someday. - Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.50,0:38:27.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.60,0:38:33.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会站到最后\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna be the last man standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.30,0:38:38.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.08,0:38:49.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等我离开了你会非常想我  达里尔·迪克森\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna miss me so bad when I'm gone, Daryl Dixon.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.48,0:38:55.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你完全不是个快乐的醉鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ain't a happy drunk at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.82,0:38:58.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很快乐  只是不瞎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm happy. I'm just not blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.90,0:39:05.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得着眼现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to stay who you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.00,0:39:06.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而不是怀恋过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}not who you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.30,0:39:11.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Places like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.81,0:39:14.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须忘记\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have to put it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.21,0:39:18.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,忘不了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if you can't?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.75,0:39:20.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,必须忘记\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.08,0:39:24.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,否则会难受死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or it kills you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.13,0:39:35.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在心里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.64,0:39:46.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们该进去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should go inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.35,0:39:55.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们该把屋子烧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should burn it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.10,0:40:16.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要更多酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna need more booze.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.19,0:41:00.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你要来吗  -必须的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You wanna? - Hell, yeah.
